    "Scan of the 1979 edition of the Rockfield, Kentucky, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1952; aerial photographs from 1972; field checked in 1973; photo inspected in 1979; printed in 1988.",
